B.cQv=new A.u("Rooms, recording, takes and the Open Mic cost us almost nothing to run, so they are free and will stay free \u2014 charging for them would be charging for the reason to open the app.\n\nA song sheet is the one thing that costs real money each time. Either kind runs on a graphics card we rent by the second, which pulls the instruments apart so the chords can be read off the music and the words off the singing. That is where the money goes.\n\nThe free one stops there and gives you the sheet: chords over your words, the key, the tempo and the bars. The full one goes over the recording again to name the parts, and keeps every instrument as its own track to solo, mute or play along with. More machine time and more storage, every song, which is what you would be paying for.\n\nThat is also why a full analysis uses a credit, and why running it again on a recording that has had one does not: the second time is ours.\n\nKeeping what you record costs a little for every month it is kept, which is why each plan has a space. Nothing is deleted for being over it, and nothing is deleted by a clock.",null,B.cCY,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
