B.bYu=s(["ask","help","request","collaborate","collaborator","musician","find","bass","drummer","singer","song"],t.s)
B.aJg=new A.cv("ask","How do I ask somebody for help on a song?",'It depends on whether you have somebody in mind, and whether they are on the app.\n\nIf they are: find them in the Open Mic, open their profile, and ask them. They see the one song you named and nothing else of yours until they say yes.\n\nIf they are not on the app yet: on the Open Mic, tap "Ask somebody you know". It writes a message about one of your songs for you to send them, and it opens that one song to them, nothing else of yours.\n\nIf you have nobody in mind: put the song on the Open Mic and say what it needs. It then shows up for people who play that part, and they can offer.',B.bYu)
B.dfa=s(["/notifications","ask_card_reply"],t.s)
B.bIU=s(["asked","invite","invited","invitation","notification","bell","accept","decline","yes","request","join","song"],t.s)
B.aIJ=new A.cv("answer-ask","Somebody asked me to play on their song. Where is it?","In your notifications \u2014 the bell in the top corner. Open it and you can say yes or no.\n\nSaying yes gives you that one song, not the rest of their work. Saying no tells them and nothing else happens.",B.bIU)
B.dg7=s(["songs_new_room","door_band"],t.s)
B.bFk=s(["room","rooms","band","group","folder","catalog","organise","organize","make","create","new"],t.s)
B.aJI=new A.cv("rooms","What is a room, and how do I make one?","A room is who can see a set of songs \u2014 your band, a side project, or just the songs you write on your own. Every song lives in one, and the room decides who hears it.\n\nMake one from Your music: press New, then Room. On a Your music with nothing in it yet, Start something together makes one and asks who to invite. Your first song goes into Ideas, your own room, without asking; after that New, then Song, asks where it goes and can make the room on the way.",B.bFk)
B.dg3=s(["room_thread_invite","invite_link"],t.s)
B.bLT=s(["invite","add","member","bandmate","friend","room","join","collaborator","people"],t.s)
B.aJ4=new A.cv("invite-room","How do I invite somebody to my room?","Open the room and press the person icon in the top corner.\n\nA room invitation is everything in it, now and later \u2014 so if you only want somebody on one song, ask them to play on that song instead. You can also invite somebody you met on the Open Mic straight from their profile.",B.bLT)
B.dg4=s(["room_thread_members"],t.s)
B.c1g=s(["remove","kick","member","leave","left","quit","band","delete","room"],t.s)
B.aJM=new A.cv("remove-member","How do I remove somebody from a room?","Open the room, then the members list, and remove them there. They lose the room and every song in it.\n\nWhat they already recorded stays \u2014 a take keeps its author, and removing somebody does not erase the work they did with you.",B.c1g)
